    "objetivo": "Replace «a» + a person with «mi, ti, gli, le» and the other indirect object pronouns, tell direct from indirect, and use «servire» to say what you need. Avoid the English-speaker traps: hiding the «to», using «la» for «telefonare», and making the participle agree.",
